      "message": "Ack.\n\nI think we need:\nelse if (active cable) {\n  if (high VDM/VDO versions) {\n     if(cable does not support USB4)\n         return false;\n   } else\n      if (does not support TBT and TBT entry is not done)\n         return false;\n}\n\nThis way, if higher cables version that do support USB4, don\u0027t go into else (and wait for TBT SOP\u0027/SOP\u0027\u0027 completion.",
